WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:04.409
Hey guys, I wanted to make a video that's a little out of the norm from what I usually do.

00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:09.960
Uh, this is in relation to the Stoneman Douglas shootings and first and foremost

00:00:10.030 --> 00:00:15.509
I have to say that I'm incredibly proud of the way the kids have been handling themselves, how they've been

00:00:15.850 --> 00:00:20.100
demonstrating all across the country in the organization of marches and talks with

00:00:20.740 --> 00:00:28.500
people in political spheres. And usually, I stay out of anything that has to do with politics or religion or anything of the above.

00:00:29.349 --> 00:00:34.109
But in this particular case, I felt I needed to say something because

00:00:35.530 --> 00:00:41.250
some of my fans have been affected by this and some of my fans are out there

00:00:42.010 --> 00:00:48.300
demonstrating about this. And I wanted to say something because I don't feel it's right that kids

00:00:48.610 --> 00:00:51.809
have to be the ones on the frontlines of this fight.

00:00:52.629 --> 00:00:58.829
And - and I wanted to throw in my support and give my thoughts on the matter for whatever that may be worth.

00:00:59.140 --> 00:01:01.140
But to give you a background, um,

00:01:02.289 --> 00:01:05.579
I have an extensive background and experience with guns.

00:01:06.210 --> 00:01:08.170
My father was a

00:01:08.170 --> 00:01:11.250
24-year Army man. He was a member of the NRA.

00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:16.110
He taught me about guns from a very early age, and he taught me to respect them

00:01:16.110 --> 00:01:21.479
and how to properly handle guns. I have gone to the shooting range many times. I've shot all kinds of guns.

00:01:22.030 --> 00:01:25.559
My dad even built muzzle loader rifles as a hobby.

00:01:26.290 --> 00:01:33.749
So, when I say these things, just know that it's not coming from a place of ignorance.

00:01:34.570 --> 00:01:43.800
And first and foremost, I want to say that I don't think people should be able to access assault rifles.

00:01:44.110 --> 00:01:50.300
There's no beating around the bush. There's no kidding about it. There's no exaggerations.

00:01:50.350 --> 00:01:56.549
Assault rifles exist solely to kill people. And you could say the same thing about all guns,

00:01:56.549 --> 00:02:02.549
but assault rifles are especially - they don't have any purpose in hunting. They have a purpose in

00:02:03.430 --> 00:02:06.510
self-defense, only to the point where they can kill

00:02:07.120 --> 00:02:12.000
multiple people with a lot of bullets in a very large magazine.

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:15.310
And...

00:02:15.310 --> 00:02:18.119
I know I'm going out on a limb into saying this outright

00:02:18.120 --> 00:02:24.120
but, I'm a hundred percent in the field that we need to ban assault rifles.

00:02:24.640 --> 00:02:31.259
And I know that people will say that gun control laws are not the thing that can change this,

00:02:31.540 --> 00:02:36.150
or at least they'll say that it's not the only thing that can change this. But in my mind

00:02:36.900 --> 00:02:41.820
why not do everything in our power to try to protect our kids?

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:48.980
Or our people, or our fellow countrymen or our neighbors. And in the avenue of trying to attack this from both sides,

00:02:49.120 --> 00:02:50.860
why don't we stop

00:02:50.860 --> 00:02:57.580
stigmatizing mental health? Why don't we stop treating it like some sort of problem that people just need to bear alone?

00:02:57.760 --> 00:03:04.140
That should be the first and foremost if everything not just in these, but in general because there's so many people out there

00:03:04.239 --> 00:03:10.409
suffering silently with mental illnesses that need help and are so afraid to go out and get it,

00:03:10.600 --> 00:03:17.279
because of the way we treat it in this country. And also why do we require more licensing and registration

00:03:17.920 --> 00:03:20.519
for cars than we do for guns?

00:03:20.590 --> 00:03:26.790
I know that people abide very closely by the Second Amendment, and me as a proud American,

00:03:26.860 --> 00:03:29.009
I'm very proud of our Constitution.

00:03:29.010 --> 00:03:32.940
But at the same time there has to be some measure of control.

00:03:33.280 --> 00:03:37.079
I know that people want to be able to bear arms

00:03:37.079 --> 00:03:40.919
and I respect that. I come from a family that was all about that.

00:03:40.930 --> 00:03:45.299
But that doesn't mean that we can't have some measure of control over these

00:03:45.640 --> 00:03:52.589
extremely dangerous tools. In the end people will say that I'm spouting ignorance or that I don't know what I'm talking about.

00:03:52.799 --> 00:03:55.769
Or that I'm saying things that are wrong, and that is fine.

00:03:56.230 --> 00:04:02.009
But right now, the only thing that I can think of is why shouldn't we be doing absolutely

00:04:02.650 --> 00:04:05.370
everything in our power to help?

00:04:06.910 --> 00:04:09.570
Now is not the time for talk.

00:04:09.970 --> 00:04:16.260
Now is not the time for empty promises. Now is the time to do something for

00:04:16.630 --> 00:04:19.169
the people that are suffering most from this.

00:04:21.090 --> 00:04:27.320
And I want to end this by saying that these kids that are out demonstrating, they are an inspiration.

00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:33.500
An absolute inspiration, not just to me but to everybody watching across the country.

00:04:33.500 --> 00:04:37.489
And if you're watching this and you are out there demonstrating or you're organizing marches.

00:04:37.490 --> 00:04:42.380
Or you're talking to the people who are supposedly in power of these decisions,

00:04:43.139 --> 00:04:44.910
keep it up.

00:04:44.910 --> 00:04:48.529
Cause the world is listening, the country is listening.

00:04:48.690 --> 00:04:55.699
People will try to ignore you and people will try to dismiss your opinion, but you are the future of this country

00:04:56.460 --> 00:05:02.329
and you are the future of the world, and your actions dictate what our future will be.

00:05:04.289 --> 00:05:06.769
So, don't give up the fight, stay strong

00:05:06.769 --> 00:05:07.789
and

00:05:09.240 --> 00:05:10.680
thanks for watching.

00:05:11.600 --> 00:05:12.200
Bye.

